WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:04.120
The skills that each of you have honed,

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.740
and the bonds you've
built between yourselves...

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.410
The Shinobi Masters is a tournament
to determine the ultimate shinobi team.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:16.010
There's no guarantee you'll
return with all of your limbs.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.410
Are you all certain you're ready?

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.070
Of course!

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:27.050
Renka, eldest of the Three
Mikagura Sisters!

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.300
Hanabi, second-eldest!

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:35.550
I'm the third sister, Kafuru!

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.800
Naraku, protector of the jewel.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.620
If you've got youma trouble,
leave it to me!

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.060
It's me, Kagura!

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.070
We're comin' through!

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.900
What are you doing here?

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.420
We were invited, too.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.330
I like this place!

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.100
It's gonna be one hell of a festival!

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.320
We're gonna blast
off some big fireworks!

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.650
Yay! Tamaya!

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:00.820
Nice!

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:03.840
I knew you'd come.

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:07.580
Don't forget the promise you made!

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:11.920
Oh?

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:15.590
It seems we have another guest.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.970
Asuka-san...

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:41.990
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:42.740
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:43.450
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:43.790
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.960
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.960
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.080
Asuka-san...

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.230
I'm sorry,

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:10.910
but without an invitation, you can't
participate in the Shinobi Masters.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:16.920
You'll have to watch as a guest
from the bleachers.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.580
Yumi, we have bigger problems
than Asuka-san right now.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.560
Yes.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:22.840
You're right.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.410
Now that everyone's here...

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.960
Gekkou, Senkou, explain the rules.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:29.900
Rule #1...

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:34.190
Each match will be between two of
the three teams in a round robin format.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.390
Rule #2...

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:39.450
Each team will declare
a captain for each match.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:40.490
Rule #3...

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:44.330
When the captain loses,
the match is over.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.740
How do we decide who wins?

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.020
Rule #4...

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.470
Each match in the Shinobi Masters
tournament will have different rules.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.790
Each set of rules will be
announced before the match.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.500
What?

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.250
That's all of the rules.

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.870
No matter what the battle is,

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.260
we're ready for it.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:05.770
But once it's over,

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.550
you're going to release
the Hanzo students.

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:10.020
Understood?

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.020
Of course...

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.560
Once it's all over.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.680
Our captain has to be Yumi-chin, right?

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.680
Yes, leave it to me.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:27.300
But isn't there something weird
about this Shinobi Masters thing?

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.930
They've got all the Hanzo
students as hostages,

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:32.430
but they're still putting
on this big tournament.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:35.930
It's bizarre that they'd stream
video of the tournament.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:40.040
All they're doing is showing shinobi
all over the world how evil they are.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.530
We all have a lot of questions,

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.600
but for now,

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.490
let's try and win.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:47.810
For the sake of the Hanzo girls.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.230
I see...

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.800
So Asuka-chan gave you that wound.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.440
I didn't let my guard down.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:01.320
But Asuka fought in a
different way than usual.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.690
What happened to her, do you think?

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:09.240
Is it related to the fact that her
friends have been taken hostage?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.320
It feels like there's more to it than that.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.210
If she was fighting for her friends,

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:19.360
I would've felt more passion from her!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.210
It's like...

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.650
On that day, Asuka...

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:29.210
In this world, there is no justice!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:34.010
Those were the eyes of someone who'd
felt despair because of something.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:39.210
Despair?

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.730
That's not like her.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:45.230
But I felt her uncertainty.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:49.910
It's proof that her heart isn't dead yet.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.490
If she's uncertain, she can rise up again.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.230
And if she needs help to do it,

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:57.900
I'll lend her a hand.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:02.000
Haruka, has the date for the 
Shinobi Masters been decided?

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.640
Oh, that...

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:09.470
I told them we weren't coming.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:14.570
We didn't know when
you were waking up, you know.

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:18.610
We couldn't leave you here.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.410
I see... Sorry.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.920
The match was supposed to start today.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.080
Today? Great!

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:29.520
We're rogue shinobi.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.490
It doesn't matter if we canceled.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:34.090
We always have good manners,

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.490
but we never follow the rules!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.000
I see.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.140
That's right.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.590
There should still
be something we can do.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:47.690
Then let's do what rogue shinobi do.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:53.100
If you're okay, then we'll
follow you. That's all.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:58.830
Shinobi transform!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.610
Homura's Crimson Squad,

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.860
here we go!

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.360
Okay,

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.720
time for the first match to begin.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.360
This is what you'll be doing!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.370
<b>Naked</b>

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.370
<b>Dodge</b>

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:13.370
<b>Ball</b>

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.370
<b>Naked
 Dodgeball</b>

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:16.370
Naked Dodgeball!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:17.930
Dodgeball, huh?

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.650
That sounds fun!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:22.840
If it weren't for the "naked" thing.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:23.880
Checkmate.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.450
This ball is a bomb.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.750
A single touch is
all it needs to explode.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:33.260
But if you catch it with 
these gloves, it won't go off.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:37.770
If you hit the enemy captain with
the ball and it explodes, you win.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.240
Explodes?

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.900
That sounds dangerous!

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:44.120
<i>Both teams, announce your captain!</i>

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.140
I will be Gessen's captain.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.770
<b>Deadly
 Cram School</b>

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.770
<b>Gessen Girls Academy
Match One: Captain Yumi</b>

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.470
This time, I'll be the captain!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.280
We've been waiting for that!

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.780
<b>Captain
 Renka</b>

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.780
<b>Mikagura
 Match One</b>

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.780
It's not Kagura-chan?

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.260
Looks like we caught 'em off guard!

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:02.090
It's all part of our brilliant
plot to surprise you

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.790
and win the mental game!

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:05.790
Wow, that's amazing.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.700
Hmm, you don't seem very surprised!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.300
'Cause you wouldn't shut your mouth.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.110
<i>Round start!</i>

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.240
Leave it to me!

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.110
Too easy! Take this!

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:44.970
Seriously?!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.210
We'll start with you!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:50.830
Oh no!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:53.670
Muracchi?

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.600
Muracchi!

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.480
Murakumo from Gessen is out!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.890
Are you sure it's a good idea
for the captain to go after the ball?

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:21.540
Yes.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:25.230
I have no intention of being a captain
who only lets others protect her.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.620
That's my Yumi-chan!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:30.420
You should watch out for Fubuki-chan!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.570
She's scarier than she looks!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.800
You let your guard down, Yumi-chan!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.480
Naraku!

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:38.390
Kagura...

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.890
End Ball!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.790
You're the one who
let your guard down.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.970
Looks like it's all over.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.020
I'm sorry.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.520
It's all part of the game.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.050
Hoarfrost Fan!

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.520
I won't let you!

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.650
No fair!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.160
Match over!

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.500
Gessen Girls' Academy
are the winners of the first match!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.300
Ow... What was I doing?

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:12.650
The plan was for the captain to keep
running until the end of the match.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:13.680
No.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.400
Thank you, Renka-chan.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.410
Sheesh...

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.050
It's your job to protect Kagura-chan,
not the other way around.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.100
But thank you.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.250
Sure thing.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.240
Good job, Sister Renka.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.500
I'm so glad Kagura-chan
didn't lose all her clothes!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.060
Listen, Yumi-chan.

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:35.280
I meant what I said about Fubuki-chan.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.700
Take care of the rest, okay?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.540
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.540
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:58.540
The second match is Naked Cavalry!

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.300
<b>Naked</b>

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.300
<b>Cav</b>

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:56.300
<b>alry</b>

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.550
<b>Naked
Cavalry</b>

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.550
<i>For this match,</i>

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:04.910
<i>the team whose captain
falls to the ground loses!</i>

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:08.050
This time, Kagura-chan
is the captain, huh?

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:10.410
If they win this match,

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.940
they can still win the tournament.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:17.000
They probably plan to give up on
strategy and just fight with all they have.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.820
Kagura, let's go!

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:27.810
Disperse!

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:28.760
Follow them!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.370
You can also defeat
the horses first, too!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:36.210
If they have no horses to ride,
 they've as good as lost!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.090
They won't beat us that easily!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.130
Breed me!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.940
I told you, we're done playing horsey!

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:42.850
Are you stupid?

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.390
Secret Ninja Art:

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.220
Dead Fox!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.520
Secret Ninja Art:

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.560
Purple Lightning!

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.530
I want to go home.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.310
Hey, Murasaki!

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:02.150
Kagura!

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.160
Take this!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.420
Miyabi is coming!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.660
Don't drop her!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.460
Isn't this against the rules?

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.460
She's on top of a horse, so it's okay.

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.100
That's my Miyabi-chan!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.480
Too easy!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.850
What an amazing battle.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:35.940
Yes.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:41.960
No!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.700
Miyabi!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.580
Imu, I'm sorry!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.200
It's nothing.

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:53.950
Anything for you, Miyabi...

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:55.460
Kagura!

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:58.720
Here we go!

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.710
I touched the ground, so I lose, right?

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.140
<i>The winners of the second match are</i>

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.900
<i>Hebijo Clandestine Girls' Academy!</i>

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.900
What was that?

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:17.720
It's like Kagura-chan lost deliberately!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.320
Now, the next battle will
be Hebijo versus Gessen.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.320
Youma have appeared
from the Kikai Dome

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:36.500
and all the jonin there disappeared?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.920
Attempts to determine
their safety have failed,

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.990
likely due to a barrier
created by the youma?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.440
They may have been wiped out.

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:47.130
Expect the worst.

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:50.140
The only available shinobi are students.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.180
There's no time for this
"Shinobi Masters" tournament.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.370
It was you, Suzune-sensei?

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.580
Homura?

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:01.690
What are you doing here?

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:07.000
We're here to save the girls
from Hanzo Academy.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.200
We owe them a lot.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:11.970
Then you're here for
the same reason I am.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.610
Will you come with me?

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.610
Even as rogue shinobi,

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:18.960
you are still our teacher.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:19.980
Very well.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.460
Then begin the mission!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.880
It's time for the third match!

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.460
Both of you have won one match.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.050
This match will determine the victor.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.480
And this is the next match!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.470
<b>Naked</b>

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.470
<b>Pole</b>

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:38.140
Naked Pole-Toppling!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.470
<b>Toppling</b>

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.480
<b>Naked
Pole-Toppling</b>

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:50.160
If your captain takes the flag, you win.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.920
If you take the flag...

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.740
Not the pole.

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:58.200
<i>If you fall into the water below,</i>

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.880
<i>your swimsuit will become transparent.</i>

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.760
Again?

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:06.010
Both teams, announce your captains!

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:10.550
I will be Hebijo's captain
for round three as well!

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.010
<b>Captain
Miyabi</b>

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.010
<b>Hebijo Clandestine Girls' Academy
Match Three</b>

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:13.560
For round three,

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:17.750
the Gessen Girls' Academy
captain will be Yozakura-san!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:18.520
Okay!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.020
<b>Captain
Yozakura</b>

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.020
<b>Gessen Girls' Academy
 Match Three</b>

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:21.840
Okay,

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:23.660
let the match begin!

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:26.020
Let's see who wins!

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:29.030
I see...

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.260
The plan is to get in my way, huh?

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.680
But look at your own captain!

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.630
I keep shooting and shooting!

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.290
I won't stop!

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:43.790
Ricochet Prelude!

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:47.250
I've shut down Yozakura
with Ryobi and Ryona.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.800
You can't win!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.480
We don't know that yet.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.720
Somebody...

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:54.810
Help me!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.640
It's three against two,
 and we're still losing!

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.700
What's going on here?

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:08.370
When we're together, my sister and I can't lose.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.820
Murasaki, you look so grown-up!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.820
Rolling Thunder!

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.550
You sisters get along so well.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:24.330
But...

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.420
We won't lose, either!

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.330
Go!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.830
Ku Soku ZIX!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.720
Hooray!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.850
Oops...

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.350
I'll have to take a chance.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.200
Let's follow her, stupid dog!

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.360
Woof! Woof! Wait!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.020
Black Ice!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.280
Joyful Inferno!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.780
It's been a long time
since we've really fought.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.330
It has.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.380
Now let's see who's
the strongest shinobi.

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:05.650
Decide the strongest shinobi?

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.370
That's wrong.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:09.130
What?

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:11.630
Homura, look!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.670
We need to save them.

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:18.650
Mirai, wait.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.430
What's that doing here?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.240
A youma?

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.650
Thousand Fists of Paradise!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.270
Now!

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:40.330
Hell and Paradise Rocket Punch!

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:43.310
Fubuki-san, the girl behind this,

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:47.540
said that the Shinobi Masters was a battle
to determine the strongest shinobi team.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.040
Shinobi team?

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.540
That's right.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.590
We've been waiting for this moment!

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:53.600
What?

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:59.900
<i>The winner of the third match
is Gessen Girls Academy!</i>

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:05.100
So you were after this from the start?

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.010
Yes.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.450
We won, somehow.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:12.600
You did a great job out there.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.250
We were able to win thanks to you.

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:18.580
No, we only won because
you distracted Miyabi-san.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.580
Stand tall even if you lose.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.630
Loss is but another step toward
becoming the strongest.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.920
We have won.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.040
Now release the Hanzo girls.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.270
Won?

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.450
You seem to have misunderstood.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.690
This was only the qualifying round.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:41.530
You still have another match.

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:42.340
What?

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:48.350
Your final opponents are us three.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.000
No way.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.890
I'm too tired to move.

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:55.000
Wait.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.320
We just fought Hebijo, and we're...

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:02.240
I told you that there was no guarantee
you'd return with all of your limbs.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:06.210
Your weakness is pathetic.

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.620
Did you know that when
he was a younger shinobi,

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:13.380
Kurokage-sama's motto was,
 "If they get you, get them back"?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:19.250
Did you think you could pursue
justice without that indomitable will?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.390
How do you know Grandpa Kurokage?

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.780
We are his followers.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:30.900
At this point, we understand
him better than you do.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:33.120
Now stand.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.270
If you refuse, we'll crush
you without mercy.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:38.400
That is Kurokage-sama's justice.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.150
Get back, Yumi-chan.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.210
I'll fight them.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.400
Asuka-san!

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:48.260
This is a place for 
determining the strongest.

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:50.910
You lost to us.
 What are you doing here?

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:53.420
I'm here for one thing.

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:55.420
To defeat you!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.910
That's all.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.160
Can you do it?

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.180
Now that you know everything.

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.680
I can do it because I know everything!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.600
I will fight, too.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:07.680
Don't get in my way.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:12.850
Asuka-san...

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:13.910
Come with me.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:17.440
Here.

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:22.380
I felt certain you'd come here,

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.600
so I brought this to give to you.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.140
Asuka-san,

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.740
do you remember that snowy day?

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:35.400
We went shopping, and then to a café.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:38.510
I had a great time.

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:41.390
Everyone traveling
the streets was smiling.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:44.020
The world seemed so bright and shiny.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:46.520
And so I thought...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:50.350
As a shinobi, I want to protect
everyone's smiles!

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.120
So what?

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:56.460
Before, when my justice
was a twisted thing,

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:59.670
you put your life on the line to correct me.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:01.530
Ever since then,

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:07.120
I've always thought the honest
words you said were wonderful.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:12.120
And that's why I'm going to say this.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:16.460
Asuka-san, there is justice in this world.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.900
There is a meaning
in both sword and shield.

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:20.880
If you say that's wrong,

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:25.880
then this time, I'll risk
my own life to protect you.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.380
If you want to fight with me, then fine.

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:31.300
Okay!

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:32.490
Yumi...

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.690
It's okay.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:34.890
We'll win for sure.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.190
Shinobi transformation!

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:47.770
Don't blame me if you regret it.

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:27.750
Lick-lick!

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:30.840
Why are you licking
me on the forehead?!

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:30.840
Stupid dog!

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:35.420
A good ninja who associates
with evil ninjas...

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:40.250
Asuka-san... I cannot forgive you!
